a community organizer, a legislative staffer, a health care advocate, and for the last 11 years I have been a state representative.

17
00:01:52,181 --> 00:02:00,931
So I'm right now the state rep for South Medford, Hillside, parts of Somerville, Winter Hill, and Teal Square, the Tufts area.

18
00:02:03,472 --> 00:02:08,795
And really, I started out as working, I worked in the state house.

19
00:02:09,275 --> 00:02:13,998
I worked on Massachusetts healthcare reform over 20 years ago.

20
00:02:14,698 --> 00:02:19,001
And I saw how the system worked and how it didn't work and who wasn't in the room.

21
00:02:19,301 --> 00:02:31,368
