As state representative, because I represent Somerville parts of Somerville and Medford already.

121
00:10:12,670 --> 00:10:34,241
What I do as state rep is try to get out into the community as much as I can, not just at, you know, everyone goes to the events or the festivals or whatever, but going to senior housing, going to some of the youth events that they're having and trying to meet people in their neighborhood where they are, you know, the senior

122
