127
00:10:59,690 --> 00:11:01,592
So yes, I have been,

128
00:11:02,932 --> 00:11:19,266
The way I work is trying to get out into the community and go to as many things as I can, because, yeah, people's experience are very different than mine, and I want to get to know them, go to different cultural events, hear what is happening in their lives and what's working and not working.

129
00:11:19,546 --> 00:11:22,949
