145
00:13:10,665 --> 00:13:21,756
So, you know, people in the meeting with the Chamber of Commerce and hearing about what, you know, all sorts of businesses that we already have and then what they need and where.

146
00:13:22,757 --> 00:13:26,239
there could be state programs to help support, you know, where they're at already.

147
00:13:26,379 --> 00:13:38,428
