152
00:13:53,597 --> 00:14:05,402
One bill that I have worked on is one that would tax online realtors, sorry, retailers, online retailers to support businesses.

153
00:14:05,822 --> 00:14:10,925
So it would create sort of a fund for like a downtown fund.

154
00:14:10,965 --> 00:14:17,408
So you could put more money into, you know, main streets or a chamber program that was really trying to support businesses.

155
00:14:18,288 --> 00:14:29,337
We haven't passed that yet, but I think that that kind of program that would tax online retailers, which we know are taking so much of the business and really drive it back into downtowns.

156
00:14:31,362 --> 00:14:37,024
Another one is grants, like I do a lot of work on, I'm the chair of the Environment Committee.

157
00:14:37,064 --> 00:14:38,625
So we have like the Clean Energy Center.

158
00:14:39,005 --> 00:14:49,088
There are some businesses, especially on Mystic Ave that work in clean energy that are starting to take off because they're close to the universities and to researchers.

159
00:14:49,548 --> 00:14:55,590
