162
00:15:12,843 --> 00:15:27,343
Transit, I worked on the Green Line extension, you know, making sure we have buses that we've been fighting to keep a bunch of the bus routes and then the roads and making sure the roads have are there, there is parking, there are ways for people to get around.

163
00:15:29,801 --> 00:15:45,337
and making sure people can actually get to get to these businesses to if their retail to to, you know, get foot traffic, especially in Medford Square and parts of the West Medford need a lot of traffic really driving people there.

164
